  The slides_spec line 'கருங்கல்பட்டியில் உள்ள இறைச்சிக் கடையில் வேலை செய்தவர்' is placed under the 'மீண்டும் கைது' slide, mixing his job into the re-arrest fact; this is a mixing of separate facts in one slide.
  The reel_script says the nearest date is 'செப்டம்பர் 24ஆம் தேதி' and the article says 'கடந்த செப்., 24ல்', which is consistent, but the reel_script says the court issued the warrant on that date as well as the caption; no error there, but the article gives no year for the warrant, so this is acceptable.
